OL,3,GNEWSAReopening popular woodland walk
OL,4,Awill cost #30,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FReopening a popular south of Scotland
OL,7,Fwoodland walk will cost a council an
OL,8,Festimated #30,000.
OL,10,FTank Wood in Moffat forms a link
OL,11,Fbetween two paths but has been closed
OL,12,Fsince October last year due to safety
OL,13,Fconcerns over fallen trees and
OL,14,Fbranches.
OL,16,FA report to Dumfries and Galloway
OL,17,FCouncil's Annandale and Eskdale area
OL,18,Fcommittee recognised its closure was
OL,19,F"causing a detriment to people's
OL,20,Fenjoyment of the local area".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
