OL,3,GNEWSAReopening popular woodland walk
OL,4,Awill cost #30,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a tree survey has recommended
OL,7,Fthat seven trees be removed and
OL,8,Fremedial work carried out on nearly 100
OL,9,Fmore before it can be opened again.
